    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88498.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "Welcome. My name is Alan Roth, president of Secure America Now. Today, we are privileged to have on our podcast, George to Congressman.com. Doug is the ranking Republican on the House Judiciary Committee. And he first came to my attention when he led the charge to sanction Congresswoman Ilhan Omar for her anti-Semitic outbursts. Congressman Collins, were you surprised that the Democratic leadership in the House chose not to take action against Omar?",
