        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'anti-Semitic outbursts' carries a clear and accepted meaning among the intended audience.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Sanctioning a member of Congress requires a formal process initiated by a committee leader.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "It is morally significant whether a politician responds appropriately to allegations of antisemitism.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The Democratic leadership’s decision not to act reflects poorly on their judgment or commitment to accountability.",
        "confidence": 0.87
