    "turn_text": "Unfortunately, not surprised. It could be Lady Allen. Not surprised. Disheartened. frustrated, broken-hearted over a system that has bent to the will of folks who have now chosen to use the congressional platform for anti-Semitic behavior that has never been tolerated before. I think I was more, frankly, I was not surprised. I don't think it's a lot work. Probably broken-hearted is that just seeing the way it was handled and how they actually handled it with their own caucus members.",
