    "turn_text": "You have, as the ranking member of the House Judiciary Committee, I wonder if you could comment on a, what I would call, spreading disease of governments opting out of enforcing the law. And in some cases, being antagonistic towards federal authorities, especially on the immigration issue. Our membership, which is over 4 million strong, they react in the most negative way to what is called sanctuary city, sanctuary state, where the government of those localities simply close their eyes to what the law is. What is your reaction to the sole sanctuary move?",
