    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's been my reaction has been pretty visceral ever since it started. And I've been on the floor and people can go to our YouTube page or our page and actually look at some of my statements and four speeches that I gave on this. And the question is, is this is simply the old becoming new again. We fought a civil war in our country over this issue of federalism that states rise. And the question of being able to nullify law that you just don't like, we have determined that that's not within the power. to do that, and why are we returning to that? And here's the issue part that I think is the people need to be aware of, whether it be, you know, a city in New York or California, or wherever, where they're trying to do this is, why just immigration? Why is it your hot button issue is just immigration? And they choose, they can choose political issue here of immigration to ignore, while at the same time, putting many times their own public risk, because what I goes after and they can what we were trying and the customer of water folk are those have done harm those that are being removed from our country or those that are having to come here legally",
